      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "If `lengthAtOffset` is non `NULL`, the number of bytes addressable at the pointer is returned.",
      "contextAfter": "The caller can compare (`offset`+`lengthAtOffset`) with `totalLength` to determine whether the entire `CMBlockBuffer` has been referenced and whether it is possible to access the `CMBlockBuffer`’s data with a contiguous reference.",
